      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag is-sky">Module 2 · Announced for another session</span>
        <h3>Youth coordination app</h3>
        <p>Design the <strong>features</strong> youth coordination actually needs: the need and workflow each feature serves, the coordination areas it improves, and the simplest useful version — asking directly: <em>what does WhatsApp fail at here?</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="punch">Module 1 maps what AI infrastructure means for climate. Module 2 designs the tool youth deserve to coordinate against it. <strong>Today is Module 1.</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>

